    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The best available evidence for an association between amount of sugars and risk of dental caries comes from which type of study design?\n\n\nOptions: \nA. Case-control study\nB. Longitudinal study\nC. Non-randomised controlled\nD. Cross sectional observational\nE. Experimental study\nF. Meta-analysis\nG. Qualitative study\nH. Randomised controlled\nI. Cohort\nJ. Ecological study\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
