    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "McClane stops Stuart and Esperanza by hitching a ride on the wing of their escape plane and blocking the ailerons with his jacket to prevent takeoff. After being knocked off the wing, he opens the fuel hatch and uses his lighter to ignite the trail of fuel, which destroys the jet and kills everyone on board.\n\n\\boxed{McClane blocks the ailerons with his jacket, then opens the fuel hatch and ignites the fuel trail with his lighter, causing the plane to explode and killing Stuart, Esperanza, and everyone aboard.}",
